yer set — read-only, intentionally untouched.\n\n## Todo state\n\n- `2026-08-02--refactor-knowledge-templates-for-coherence.md` — all tasks complete.\n\n## Logs\n\n- task-stdout: templates-survey, templates-coherence-audit, templates-detail-audit, templates-archive, write-report-archive, ann-wiring-check, templates-db-untrack, scaffold-dry-run, fixes-verify, templates-refactor-close, templates-refactor-report\nEOF\necho "report written: _knowledge/_templates/report/$TS.md"\ncp _knowledge/_templates/report/$TS.md .opencode/_bitacora/task-report/$TS-templates-refactor.md\necho "root copy: .opencode/_bitacora/task-report/$TS-templates-refactor.md"\nls -la _knowledge/_templates/report/$TS.md .opencode/_bitacora/task-report/$TS-templates-refactor.md' 
